+
+/**
+ Concrete `weak_ptr<jsi::NativeState>` specialization. Same rationale as
+ `NativeStateShared`. Lets Swift hold a non-owning reference to a pointee
+ whose lifetime is otherwise managed by JSI's slot(s).
+ */
